      385.09,
      539.95,
      432.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, EranWickramaratne, Acting Minister of Finance and Mass Media, the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by thisorder impose in respect of the list of commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special CommodityLevy, at the rates specified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
